===Etymology===
From {{inh|non|gmq-pro|ᛊᛏᚨᛁᚾᚨᛉ}}, from {{inh|non|gem-pro|*stainaz||stone}}. Cognate with {{cog|ang|stān}}, {{cog|ofs|stēn}}, {{cog|osx|stēn}}, {{cog|goh|stein}}, {{cog|got|𐍃𐍄𐌰𐌹𐌽𐍃}}.<br/>Ultimately from Pre-Germanic {{m|ine-pro||*stoyh₂nos}}, o-grade of {{der|non|ine-pro|*steyh₂-||to stiffen}}.

